0..74 Comment "// Univalence at the certified strata of a signature: `ua[n, k]` derives a"
75..152 Comment "// path between two models\' degree telescopes up to degree `n` over shapes of"
153..223 Comment "// at most `k` vertices, each stage over its matching object (Shulman,"
224..285 Comment "// _Univalence for Inverse Diagrams and Homotopy Canonicity_,"
286..356 Comment "// doi:10.1017/S0960129514000565). From degree two the Segal condition"
357..433 Comment "// certifies the stages above the corollas; a degree, a bound or a table the"
434..481 Comment "// stratum does not certify is refused by name."
483..560 Comment "// The magma, the swap, the identity on the booleans and the unit\'s identity."
